Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20beta.7=20=E2=80=94=20post-stop=20transc?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ript=20auto-refine=20(base.en)=20+=20consent-gated=20PostHog=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?telemetry?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Recorder: after stop, re-transcribe the saved audio with the accurate batch
  model in the background and swap the note's Transcript section (<=30 min
  recordings; a student edit to the section always wins). New status line under
  the saved-note chip; stale design comment in transcribe.ts corrected.
- Telemetry: posthog-js behind the consent gate (CONSENT_VERSION 2026-07-14,
  a real data-practice change) with a default-on disclosed checkbox, an
  immediate opt-out switch in Settings -> Account & usage, identify by account
  uuid on sign-in, reset on sign-out, feature counters only (app_launched,
  recorder_started) + crash capture. Never chat/notes/files/recordings content.
